      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Eliminating Hidden Surcharges &amp; Demanding Written Binding Contracts for Local Intercity Shifting Charges</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>When a family hires a mover in Deoghar, the most common hidden costs appear on the day of the move. Dishonest transporters will add extra charges for seemingly trivial factors such as floor elevation, long carries, or toll taxes, turning a simple local shift into an expensive ordeal.</p>

<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #f59e0b22; color: #f59e0b; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">01</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Floor Elevations</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">A higher floor means a longer climb for the truck’s hydraulic lift. Some companies bill a flat “floor surcharge” of ₹200–₹500 per floor, even when the lift is already capable of handling the load.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #10b98122; color: #10b981; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">02</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Long Carries</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">If the route requires the driver to walk the load a few metres from the curb to the vehicle or from the vehicle to the doorstep, the transporter may charge ₹50–₹100 per metre. The longer the carry, the more the bill grows.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #3b82f622; color: #3b82f6; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">03</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Toll Taxes</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">On intercity routes, a small toll can add ₹100–₹300 to the fare. Dishonest operators sometimes claim that the toll is “in addition to the quoted price” and refuse to show the receipt.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<p>These surcharges are often justified in the last minute, making it difficult for the customer to refuse or negotiate. The result is a final bill that can exceed the original estimate by 20–30 % or more.</p>

<p>Transparent, written, binding quotes act as a shield against such practices. A formal quote lists every line item—basic rate, fuel surcharge, local taxes, and any potential extra fees—clearly stating that no other charges will be added without prior consent.</p>
<p>For local shifts within Deoghar, a binding quote typically caps the total at a fixed rate, whereas intercity moves require a detailed breakdown that includes tolls, parking fees, and any applicable state taxes.</p>

<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">When the quote is binding, the transporter is contractually obliged to honor the stated price.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>If an extra charge is later demanded, the customer can point to the discrepancy and demand a refund or a revised invoice that matches the original terms.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>This legal footing also discourages unscrupulous operators, as they risk litigation and damage to their reputation.</span></li></ul>

<p>In short, a clear, written quote not only prevents surprise costs but also provides a tangible record that protects the customer’s budget and ensures fair treatment during both local and intercity shifting in Deoghar.</p></div>
